  "segments": [
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Connection Tracking (conntrack)",
      "source_hash": 16660979616646191482,
      "context_hash": 11816358600376575228,
      "translation": "Connection Tracking(conntrack)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "conntrack": "conntrack"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:03:06.691887Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "How the kernel tracks the state of network connections for stateful firewalling and NAT",
      "source_hash": 3797606137063941261,
      "context_hash": 2203471189940674191,
      "translation": "커널이 상태 기반 방화벽과 NAT를 위해 네트워크 연결의 상태를 추적하는 방식",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "kernel": "커널"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:03:06.691888Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "What conntrack does",
      "source_hash": 17542835219894272398,
      "context_hash": 1674630695632624202,
      "translation": "conntrack의 역할",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "conntrack": "conntrack"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:03:06.691888Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Connection tracking maintains a table of all active network flows.",
      "source_hash": 4298438125622982366,
      "context_hash": 10276292002237507214,
      "translation": "연결 추적(connection tracking)은 활성 상태인 모든 네트워크 흐름의 테이블을 유지합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:03:06.691888Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "For every packet, the kernel looks up its flow in this table to determine its state (new, established, related, invalid).",
      "source_hash": 17389482622465906165,
      "context_hash": 1965325901862321203,
      "translation": "커널은 모든 패킷에 대해 이 테이블에서 해당 흐름을 조회하여 그 상태(new, established, related, invalid)를 판별합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "kernel": "커널"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:03:06.691888Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:2",
      "source": "This enables:",
      "source_hash": 5774060107790296632,
      "context_hash": 9272104067904151302,
      "translation": "이를 통해 다음이 가능해집니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:03:06.691889Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "**Stateful firewalling**: Accept replies to outbound connections without explicit rules",
      "source_hash": 10699789933572947541,
      "context_hash": 5181580109692059020,
      "translation": "**상태 기반 방화벽(stateful firewalling)**: 명시적인 규칙 없이도 외부로 나가는 연결에 대한 응답을 허용",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:03:06.691889Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "**NAT**: Track both directions of a rewritten connection",
      "source_hash": 8685122927718712060,
      "context_hash": 3702135976322803759,
      "translation": "**NAT**: 재작성된 연결의 양방향을 모두 추적",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:03:06.691889Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "**Helper modules**: Track related connections (FTP data channel, SIP RTP, etc.)",
      "source_hash": 16819490665496745492,
      "context_hash": 14264638703303144333,
      "translation": "**헬퍼 모듈**: 관련 연결 추적(FTP 데이터 채널, SIP RTP 등)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "modules": "모듈"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:03:06.691889Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:5/seg:0",
      "source": "Conntrack is implemented in `net/netfilter/nf_conntrack_core.c` and hooks at PREROUTING and OUTPUT (before routing and before NAT).",
      "source_hash": 1664059113612999693,
      "context_hash": 8958258630873508341,
      "translation": "conntrack은 `net/netfilter/nf_conntrack_core.c`에 구현되어 있으며 PREROUTING과 OUTPUT(라우팅 이전이자 NAT 이전)에 훅을 겁니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "conntrack": "conntrack",
        "hook": "훅"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:03:06.691889Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "struct nf_conn",
      "source_hash": 9554907936021864963,
      "context_hash": 10387644842544960923,
      "translation": "struct nf_conn",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:03:06.691889Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Each tracked connection is a `struct nf_conn`:",
      "source_hash": 15232063626024931117,
      "context_hash": 5515657755492599599,
      "translation": "추적되는 각 연결은 하나의 `struct nf_conn`입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:03:06.691889Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "Connection status bits (IPS_*)",
      "source_hash": 2981152112973332346,
      "context_hash": 5123994039601235516,
      "translation": "연결 상태 비트(IPS_*)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "bits": "비트"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:03:06.691889Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:5/seg:0",
      "source": "TCP-specific state",
      "source_hash": 613318944495524965,
      "context_hash": 17775733127093470036,
      "translation": "TCP 전용 상태",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "TCP": "TCP"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:03:06.691889Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Conntrack tuple",
      "source_hash": 5853159577470040307,
      "context_hash": 9948384780220008517,
      "translation": "conntrack 튜플",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "conntrack": "conntrack"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:03:06.691889Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "A **tuple** uniquely identifies a packet in one direction:",
      "source_hash": 7515866697249749362,
      "context_hash": 13474453943437856396,
      "translation": "**튜플(tuple)**은 한 방향의 패킷을 고유하게 식별합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:03:06.691890Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "Two tuples are stored per `nf_conn`: the original direction and the reply direction (which is the original reversed).",
      "source_hash": 1847956514964495806,
      "context_hash": 7411679050384001428,
      "translation": "`nf_conn`마다 두 개의 튜플이 저장됩니다. 하나는 원래 방향(original direction)이고, 다른 하나는 응답 방향(reply direction, 원래 방향을 뒤집은 것)입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:03:06.691890Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:3/seg:1",
      "source": "This is how NAT works — NAT modifies one or both tuples, and conntrack uses the reply tuple to match return traffic.",
      "source_hash": 6649897307241623112,
      "context_hash": 2623446944468656932,
      "translation": "NAT는 바로 이렇게 동작합니다. NAT는 한쪽 또는 양쪽 튜플을 수정하고, conntrack은 응답 튜플을 사용해 돌아오는 트래픽을 매칭합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "conntrack": "conntrack"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:03:06.691890Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Conntrack lifecycle",
      "source_hash": 10857552475312395226,
      "context_hash": 15607148676358784665,
      "translation": "conntrack 생명 주기",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "conntrack": "conntrack"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:03:06.691890Z",
      "issues": []
    },
