    {
      "id": "section:6/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Conntrack helpers: tracking related connections",
      "source_hash": 11373762409950650813,
      "context_hash": 17172211142426195038,
      "translation": "Conntrack helper: 관련 연결 추적",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "conntrack": "conntrack"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:08:32.046733Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Some protocols open secondary connections (FTP data channel, SIP RTP media). **Conntrack helpers** parse protocol messages to `EXPECT` these secondary connections:",
      "source_hash": 15876772378669461719,
      "context_hash": 5303043083445409773,
      "translation": "일부 프로토콜은 보조 연결(FTP 데이터 채널, SIP RTP 미디어)을 엽니다. **Conntrack helper**는 프로토콜 메시지를 파싱하여 이러한 보조 연결을 `EXPECT`합니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "conntrack": "conntrack"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:08:32.046733Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "The helper creates an **expectation** — a placeholder that matches the expected secondary connection:",
      "source_hash": 9127143364740541174,
      "context_hash": 545664034221358962,
      "translation": "helper는 예상되는 보조 연결과 일치하는 자리 표시자인 **expectation**을 생성합니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:08:32.046733Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:7/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Conntrack marks (connmark)",
      "source_hash": 15434075489527475350,
      "context_hash": 6455558992130127186,
      "translation": "Conntrack 마크(connmark)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "conntrack": "conntrack"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:08:32.046733Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:7/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Marks allow correlating firewall rules with routing or QoS:",
      "source_hash": 15746412044772231150,
